#### consumer parity

#### fix-rule primitive_api_types() equals the canonical table

- Verify: fix-rule primitive_api_types() equals the canonical table
   - Expected: ts.len() equals `canonical.len()`
   - Expected: ts[i] equals `canonical[i]`


